# ─── Private user data — never commit ─────────────────────────────────────
# VOICE_DEMO.md — now tracked: rewritten as product spec sheet (70% features).
# Loaded by server.py (_load_voice_demo) into Gemini Live system prompt.
# NOTE: this rule is deliberately generic. Naming the specific files here
# would publish their names to everyone who clones this public repo.
data/*.json
voice_debug.log
*voice_debug*.log
